# Type checking, not tests: Turborepo caches this so a clean tree is near-instant,
# while a full test run would make pushing painful enough to bypass.
# This already covers the API (apps/api typecheck runs `uv run mypy` with its
# own cwd), so no separate mypy invocation here — `uv run --project` from the
# repo root misses the `files = ["src"]` config and always fails.
pnpm turbo run typecheck
